      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing a profound sense of loss regarding your sense of self and what once gave your life meaning. Feeling obsolete or like a relic is a deeply painful experience when your core values feel unmoored from the present. Please remember that your worth is intrinsic and isn't defined by how useful you feel to the world around you. Speaking with a therapist can help you navigate these deep existential feelings and help you rediscover meaning in this new chapter.",
      "source": "target",
